      <activity id="1591fedc-69dd-5af5-a71b-4437776b2da2" activityNameId="cb976730-d979-52a6-af6b-f6c0a70c0643" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, consumer mix GO</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, consumer mix GO
Electricity domestic net production shares are based on annual averages for the year 2019.; UUID:7b3cad13-b69b-345d-a201-0d82f2f8b520
Included are the shares of domestic electricity production by technology and imports from neighbouring countries (technologies) at the busbar without the shares sold as certified electricity. Not included are transformation, transport or distribution losses.
Location: Data apply to public and self producers in Switzerland and from imports.
Wind power plants are European averages.
Technology: No technology description is provided because the dataset just describes the power plant portfolio of the respective country using current average technology per energy carrier.
Time period: Time period of statistics used.
Production volume: 
Sampling: Statistical data
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7b3cad13-b69b-345d-a201-0d82f2f8b520.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
